#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) to manage users with or without an IBM Cloud account"
msgstr "ใช้ IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) เพื่อจัดการผู้ใช้ที่มีหรือไม่มีบัญชี IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users"
msgstr "จัดการผู้ใช้ ID provider"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users {#manage-id-provider-users}"
msgstr "จัดการผู้ใช้ ID provider {#manage-id-provider-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can integrate with your external identity provider (IDP) to securely authenticate external users to your IBM Cloud account. By using an external provider, you can provide a way for users in your company to use single sign-on (SSO). You can connect your cloud account to an external IDP one of the following ways:\n"
msgstr "สามารถผสานรวมกับ external identity provider (IDP) เพื่อยืนยันตัวตนผู้ใช้ภายนอกกับบัญชี IBM Cloud อย่างปลอดภัย โดยการใช้ external provider สามารถให้วิธีสำหรับผู้ใช้ในบริษัทในการใช้ single sign-on (SSO) ได้ เชื่อมต่อ cloud account กับ external IDP ได้ด้วยวิธีใดวิธีหนึ่งต่อไปนี้:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider (SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"
msgstr "ใช้ [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider (SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (might incur a cost)\n"
msgstr "ใช้ [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (อาจมีค่าใช้จ่าย)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Federate your users to all IBM&reg; products with IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"
msgstr "[Federate ผู้ใช้ไปยัง IBM&reg; products ทั้งหมดด้วย IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"After connecting your IDP, you can set up dynamic rules so you don't have to manually add every user to every group when they join.  See [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) for instructions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"หลังจากเชื่อมต่อ IDP แล้ว สามารถตั้งค่า dynamic rules เพื่อไม่ต้องเพิ่มผู้ใช้ทุกคนในทุก group ด้วยตนเองเมื่อเข้าร่วม ดู [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) สำหรับคำแนะนำ\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "ขั้นตอนถัดไป {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * Refer to the [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration) topic.\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"คำแนะนำ\">\n"
"   * ดูหัวข้อ [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration)\n"
"   * ดู [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) สำหรับข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\n"
"   * ดู [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started) ฉบับเต็ม\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
